# Build context allowlist for the Confidential Space workload image.
#
# The context is the repository root, which contains `.env`, `.env.local`, ADC
# files under a developer's home if they ever land here, and the whole web tier.
# None of that may reach the daemon, so the rule is: exclude everything, then
# re-include exactly the paths the Dockerfile COPYs. A new COPY that forgets to
# add its path here fails the build loudly instead of silently shipping.
*

!infra/confidential-space/entrypoint.py
!infra/confidential-space/requirements.txt
!services/api/src/mcpforge/__init__.py
!services/api/src/mcpforge/logging.py
!services/api/src/mcpforge/execution

# Never, under any re-inclusion above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
